Caption: Healing curves of dinov2_vitb14_reg: validation k-NN top-1 against the healing step for every method of the main comparison, all healed with the identical recipe on the same batches. Step 0 is the converted model before healing. Lines are means over healing seeds (1, 2, 3 seeds), bands the range over seeds. Steps marked * are evaluated on 10,000 validation images, the others on all 50,000. Filled markers: exactly mirror-invariant in one forward pass. (b) enlarges the steps from 100 on for the methods that end within 3 points of the best.

